OL,4,BEngland call up McKinney for South     
OL,5,BAfrica Tests                           
OL,6,GEngland have called up uncapped Durham 
OL,7,Gopener Ben McKinney for their Test     
OL,8,Gtour of South Africa as cover for      
OL,9,Ginjured batter Jacob Bethell.          
OL,11,FThe 22-year-old, a tall and attacking  
OL,12,Fleft-hander, has long been highly-     
OL,13,Frated by England and has now been      
OL,14,Frewarded with his first international  
OL,15,Fcall-up.                               
OL,17,FIt leaves McKinney's Durham team-mate  
OL,18,FEmilio Gay, Ben Duckett and Jordan Cox 
OL,19,Fset to continue as England's top three 
OL,20,Fafter relative success through the     
OL,21,Fsummer.                                
